    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FLYTHE PACIFIC\nCANADA-USA-HAWAII\nFIJI-AUSTRALIA-NEW ZEALAND\nConnecting at San Francisco \u0026 Vancouver\nwith services to England and Europe\nwith BCPA\nFlying the sleeper equipped Douglas\n- -6\nTimetable and Fares\nEffective from October 1, 1949. All previous lists cancelled.",
      "lamp, etc.\nwindow, clothes rack, reading\nEach sleeper has its own\nCall your local travel agent or\nGeneral Agents\nAUSTRALIA:\nT.A.A.,\n339 Swanston\nSt.,\nMelbourne,\nC1.\nBooking\nOffices\nall states.\nNEW\nZEALAND\nand FIJI: N.Z.N.A.C., Mercantile Chambers,\nAuckland.\nthroughout\nHONOLULU: Theo. HA Davies \u0026 Co, Limited, Davies Building,\nHonolulu\n2.\nU.S.A.:\nB.C.P.A.\nBooking\nOffice, 347\nStockton\nSt.,\nSan\nFrancisco.\nPhone\nYUkon\n6-6971.\nB.O.A.C.:\nNew\nYork, 420\nMadison\nAve.,\nNew\nYork\nN.Y.\nAlso CHICAGO,\nLOS\nANGELES,\nWASHINGTON.\nCANADA: T.C.A.,\nHotel\nVancouver, B.C. Offices major cities.\nU.K.\nand elsewhere: B.O.A.C.\nB.C.P.A. HEAD OFFICE: A.P.A. Building, 53 Martin Place\nSydney.\nPhone\nBW 2741\n(15 lines).\nSAN\nFRANCISCO:\n347\nStockton\nSt., San\nFrancisco.\nPhone YUkon 6-6971.\netc.\nwriting,\nis a handy table for each seat for meals,\nPrinted in Australia\nThere\n5077"
    ],
